{"title": "Permanently Armed", "pageid": 13455, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Permanently_Armed", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Pact_of_the_Blade.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Pact_of_the_Blade.webp/300px-Pact_of_the_Blade.webp, /w/images/0/03/Pact_of_the_Blade.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Pact_of_the_Blade.webp/300px-Pact_of_the_Blade.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Pact_of_the_Blade.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Permanently Armed</b> is a passive feature that prevents the user from being <a href=\"/wiki/Disarming\" title=\"Disarming\">disarmed</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Creature can't be disarmed. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Air_Myrmidon\" title=\"Air Myrmidon\">Air Myrmidon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Anna_Lidwin\" title=\"Anna Lidwin\">Anna Lidwin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Anya\" title=\"Anya\">Anya</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Azer\" title=\"Azer\">Azer</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cambion_(Planar_Ally)\" title=\"Cambion (Planar Ally)\">Cambion (Planar Ally)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Clara\" title=\"Clara\">Clara</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Deva\" title=\"Deva\">Deva</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Deva_(Banite)\" title=\"Deva (Banite)\">Deva (Banite)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Displacer_beast_(illusion)\" title=\"Displacer beast (illusion)\">Displacer beast (illusion)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Djinni\" title=\"Djinni\">Djinni</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dryad_(Conjure_Woodland_Being)\" title=\"Dryad (Conjure Woodland Being)\">Dryad (Conjure Woodland Being)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Earth_Myrmidon\" title=\"Earth Myrmidon\">Earth Myrmidon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Enver Gortash</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Myrmidon\" title=\"Fire Myrmidon\">Fire Myrmidon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Flind\" title=\"Flind\">Flind</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Geanne\" title=\"Geanne\">Geanne</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Guardian_of_Faith_(creature)\" title=\"Guardian of Faith (creature)\">Guardian of Faith (creature)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hunna\" title=\"Hunna\">Hunna</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Inessa\" title=\"Inessa\">Inessa</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Julia\" title=\"Julia\">Julia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Moonlight_Sliver\" title=\"Moonlight Sliver\">Moonlight Sliver</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Carrion\" title=\"Mystic Carrion\">Mystic Carrion</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Patricia\" title=\"Patricia\">Patricia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok_Anchev\" title=\"Sarevok Anchev\">Sarevok Anchev</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sinda\" title=\"Sinda\">Sinda</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Skeleton_(Animate_Dead)\" title=\"Skeleton (Animate Dead)\">Skeleton (Animate Dead)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tribunal_Ghost\" title=\"Tribunal Ghost\">Tribunal Ghost</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Vanessa\" title=\"Vanessa\">Vanessa</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Water_Myrmidon\" title=\"Water Myrmidon\">Water Myrmidon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zealous_Assistant\" title=\"Zealous Assistant\">Zealous Assistant</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This passive blocks the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_Dropped!_(Condition)\" title=\"Weapon Dropped! (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Weapon Dropped!\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_Dropped!_(Condition)\" title=\"Weapon Dropped! (Condition)\">Weapon Dropped!</a> condition that class actions with a disarming function attempt to apply.</li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Cannot be disarmed.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202830\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 724/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4742/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2547/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2149/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643720/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.003      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   39.003      1 -total\n 34.15%   13.318      1 Template:Cond\n 24.34%    9.494      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 23.35%    9.10